"called Guillemets or angle quotes. Usage in different countries: France "
"(with non-breaking Space 0x00a0), Switzerland, Germany, Finland and Sweden.</"
"p><p><strong>&lsaquo;</strong> and <strong>&rsaquo;</strong> (U+2039/203a, "
"<code>&amp;lsaquo;/&amp;rsaquo;</code>) are their single quote equivalents.</"
"p><p>See <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Guillemets\">Wikipedia:"
"Guillemets</a></p>"
msgstr ""
"<p><strong>&laquo;</strong> (u+00ab, <code>&amp;lfquo;</code> i HTML) og "
"<strong>&raquo;</strong> (u+00bb, <code>&amp;rfquo;</code> in HTML) kaldes "
"guillemets eller dobbeltvinkler. Bruges i forskellige lande: Frankrig (med "
"hårdt mellemrum 0x00a0), Schweitz, Tyskland, Finland og Sverige. De "
"tilsvarende enkelt citationstegn er</p><p><strong>&lsaquo;</strong> og "
"<strong>&rsaquo;</strong> (U+2039/203a, <code>&amp;lsaquo;/&amp;rsaquo;</"
"code>).</p><p>Se <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/"
"Guillemets\">Wikipedia:Guillemets</a></p>"

